<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/Division> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A grouping of similar departments within a larger organization.  In the university context, also known as a school or a faculty, for example the Humanities Division, the Mathematics Faculty, or the School of Medicine."@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/Division> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/> .
